                                "sense_id": "befad7d4-66fb-38e6-94a4-e44178836d3f",
                                "text": "The lawyer and twice-divorced mother of three had presented herself as the modern face of her party, trying to strip it of unsavoury overtones after her father's convictions for saying the Nazi occupation of France was not \"particularly inhumane\".",
                                "translation": "在父亲因说纳粹对法国的占领并非“特别不人道”而被定罪后，这位有三个孩子、離過两次婚的律师母亲曾以该党的“新一代”面孔示人，试图使其摆脱因此被蒙上的不光彩。"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "91f0deae-a892-46a8-9cc6-413e2f1d15f6",
                                "sense_id": "befad7d4-66fb-38e6-94a4-e44178836d3f",
                                "text": "England consolidated their position of power in pursuit of a place at next year's World Cup in Qatar with a hugely impressive victory against Hungary in a hostile and often unsavoury atmosphere in Budapest.",
                                "translation": "在布达佩斯敌对和经常令人感到讨厌的气氛中，英格兰对匈牙利取得了一场印象深刻的胜利，从而巩固了他们追求明年卡塔尔世界杯名次的实力。"
                            }
                        ]
